<view class="p3-page emergency-page" role="main" aria-label="紧急安全指引">
  <view class="emergency-head">
    <text class="emergency-title" role="heading" aria-level="1">先找现实帮助</text>
    <view class="p3-notice p3-notice--risk safety-intro" role="note">
      <text class="p3-notice__body">如果你或孩子正在经历自伤、自杀、暴力、失控或其他安全风险，请优先联系身边可信赖的人、当地紧急服务或线下专业机构。</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="emergency-section">
    <view class="emergency-section__head">
      <text class="p3-item-title" role="heading" aria-level="2">现在先做</text>
      <text class="p3-meta">只用于稳定当下，不替代专业帮助</text>
    </view>
    <safety-action-row wx:for="{{supportSteps}}" wx:key="*this" marker="0{{index + 1}}" text="{{item}}" show-divider="{{index < supportSteps.length - 1}}" />
  </view>

  <view class="emergency-section">
    <view class="emergency-section__head">
      <text class="p3-item-title" role="heading" aria-level="2">5-4-3-2-1 接地法</text>
      <text class="p3-meta">把注意力拉回此刻</text>
    </view>
    <safety-action-row wx:for="{{groundingSteps}}" wx:key="*this" marker="{{5 - index}}" text="{{item}}" show-divider="{{index < groundingSteps.length - 1}}" />
  </view>

  <view class="p3-boundary">
    <view class="p3-boundary__rule" aria-hidden="true"></view>
    <text class="p3-boundary__title">重要边界</text>
    <text class="p3-meta">本小程序不能提供实时危机干预、医疗诊断或法律判断。遇到紧急安全风险时，请先使用现实资源。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="safety-action-dock" role="group" aria-label="安全行动">
    <button class="p3-btn p3-btn--primary safety-action" bindtap="openResources">查看现实支持资源</button>
    <button class="p3-btn p3-btn--secondary safety-action" bindtap="goHome">回到首页</button>
  </view>
</view>
